---
import PublicLayout from '../../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
import { Quote, Award, BookOpen, Compass, CheckCircle2 } from 'lucide-react';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: 'About Us', href: '/about/principals-message/' },
  { label: "Principal's Message" },
];
---

<PublicLayout
  title="Principal's Message | MJ School Shahpur"
  description="Read the official address from the Principal of MJ School, Shahpur on academic excellence, value-based pedagogy, and holistic student growth."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  pageTitle="From the Principal's Desk"
  pageSubtitle="Nurturing intellectual curiosity, ethical character, and future-ready global leaders at MJ School, Shahpur."
>
  <div class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
        
        {/* Principal Profile Sidebar */}
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-44 h-44 rounded-full mx-auto overflow-hidden border-4 border-[#C59B27] shadow-lg mb-4">
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
              alt="Principal, MJ School Shahpur"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0B2545] font-serif">Office of the Principal</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#C59B27] font-semibold mt-0.5 uppercase tracking-wider">MJ School, Shahpur</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Affiliated to CBSE, New Delhi</p>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 text-left space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-slate-600">
              <Award class="w-4 h-4 text-[#C59B27] shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
              <span>National CBSE Best Educator Recognition</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-slate-600">
              <BookOpen class="w-4 h-4 text-[#C59B27] shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
              <span>Over two decades of school leadership & curriculum innovation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-slate-600">
              <Compass class="w-4 h-4 text-[#C59B27] shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
              <span>Committed to experiential learning & NEP 2020 integration</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6">
            <a
              href="/admissions/2026/"
              class="block w-full text-center bg-[#0B2545] hover:bg-[#133E6E] text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors shadow-sm"
            >
              Admissions 2026-27 Open
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Message Body */}
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          
          <div class="bg-amber-50/70 border-l-4 border-[#C59B27] p-5 rounded-r-xl">
            <Quote class="w-8 h-8 text-[#C59B27] mb-2 opacity-80" />
            <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-[#0B2545]">
              "Education is not merely the filling of a vessel, but the kindling of an enduring flame."
            </h3>
          </div>

          <p class="text-base text-slate-800 font-medium">
            Dear Parents, Guardians, Students, and Well-Wishers,
          </p>

          <p>
            It gives me immense pleasure to welcome you to <strong>MJ School, Shahpur</strong>. At MJ School, education extends far beyond textbooks and formal examinations. We endeavor to create an intellectually stimulating ecosystem where curious minds are encouraged to question, experiment, create, and lead.
          </p>

          <p>
            Our pedagogical philosophy is anchored in the belief that every child possesses innate genius and distinct capabilities. As educators, our sacred responsibility is to provide the fertile ground, technological tools, and values-driven guidance necessary for each student to flourish. Affiliated to the <strong>Central Board of Secondary Education (CBSE)</strong>, our curriculum harmoniously merges academic rigor with emotional intelligence, scientific inquiry, environmental consciousness, and global competencies outlined in the <strong>National Education Policy (NEP 2020)</strong>.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 py-2">
            <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-4 rounded-xl">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-[#0B2545] text-sm flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" />
                Value-Rooted Pedagogy
              </h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
                Instilling Integrity (Satya), Diligence (Karmanya), and Compassion (Karuna) at every level of campus life.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-4 rounded-xl">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-[#0B2545] text-sm flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
                <CheckCircle2 class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" />
                Modern Innovation Labs
              </h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
                Immersive STEM laboratories, coding studios, and 3D Visualizers ensuring practical mastery.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p>
            A school is only as strong as the partnership between home and classroom. We invite parents to walk alongside us as active collaborators in this inspiring journey of shaping tomorrow's thinkers, changemakers, and ethical leaders.
          </p>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200">
            <p class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-[#0B2545]">Principal</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">MJ School, Shahpur</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#C59B27] font-semibold mt-0.5">Central Board of Secondary Education (CBSE)</p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</PublicLayout>
